SUMMARY:FYI: The Night Move Band
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nMusic on Main is Hendersonville's beloved S
 ummer Concert Series\, bringing live music\, community\, and summertime fu
 n to downtown Hendersonville. Gather with friends and neighbors for unforg
 ettable evenings filled with a community coming together through music. Co
 ncerts take place throughout the Summer from 7-9 pm with audience seating 
 opening after 5:30 pm. Don't forget your chairs! Concessions will be avail
 able for purchase\, making Music on Main the perfect way to spend a summer
  evening in Hendersonville.\n\nMusic on Main remains free to attend thanks
  in large part to the generosity of our community. Donations from the audi
 ence members help support performer fees\, event operations\, and the cont
 inuation of this long-standing tradition. If you enjoy the concerts and ar
 e able\, please consider making a donation the help keep the music playing
  for years to come.
