SUMMARY:Alykat Deli Subs\; lunch
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nWe will meet at ***Alykat Deli Subs for a l
 ate lunch.***\nAddress: 1201 Asheville Hwy\, Hendersonville\,\n**A limit o
 f 12 ppl are welcome to join me.**\n**Please keep your RSVP’s current. (
 I need to let them know how many we got !)**\nWe will meet inside\, find o
 ur table(s) and order.\nI will NOT join tables together. We will share mul
 tiple tables.\nI’ll have an HFF sign on the table\n**Description:** One 
 of Hendersonville's oldest and favorite restaurants - serving Subs\, Sandw
 iches\, Burgers\, Salads\, Paninis and Soups since 1974\nWebsite(s): https
 ://www.facebook.com/AlykatSubsSandwiches\nHours:\nSunday\; Closed\nMonday\
 ; 11 AM–3 PM\nTuesday\; 11 AM–3 PM\nWednesday\; 11 AM–3 
 PM\nThursday\; 11 AM–3 PM\nFriday\; 11 AM–3 PM\nSaturday\; 11
  AM–3 PM
